  <bp:ProteinReference rdf:ID="ProteinReference16">
    <bp:organism rdf:resource="#BioSource1" />
    <bp:name rdf:datatype="http://www.w3.org/2001/XMLSchema#string">UniProt:Q6PCB6 ABHD17C</bp:name>
    <bp:name rdf:datatype="http://www.w3.org/2001/XMLSchema#string">ABHD17C</bp:name>
    <bp:name rdf:datatype="http://www.w3.org/2001/XMLSchema#string">FAM108C1</bp:name>
    <bp:xref rdf:resource="#UnificationXref222" />
    <bp:comment rdf:datatype="http://www.w3.org/2001/XMLSchema#string">FUNCTION Hydrolyzes fatty acids from S-acylated cysteine residues in proteins. Has depalmitoylating activity towards NRAS and DLG4/PSD95.CATALYTIC ACTIVITY S-hexadecanoyl-L-cysteinyl-[protein] + H2O = L-cysteinyl-[protein] + hexadecanoate + H(+)ACTIVITY REGULATION Inhibited by palmostatin-B.INTERACTION Palmitoylated on cysteine residues located in a cysteine cluster at the N-terminus which promotes membrane localization. Palmitoylation is required for post-synaptic localization and for depalmitoylating activity towards DLG4/PSD95.SIMILARITY Belongs to the AB hydrolase superfamily. ABHD17 family.</bp:comment>
  </bp:ProteinReference>
