    <bp:displayName rdf:datatype="http://www.w3.org/2001/XMLSchema#string">pS181-S-Farn-Me KRAS4B binds BCL2L1</bp:displayName>
    <bp:xref rdf:resource="#UnificationXref293" />
    <bp:xref rdf:resource="#UnificationXref294" />
    <bp:comment rdf:datatype="http://www.w3.org/2001/XMLSchema#string">At the mitochondrial outer membrane, phosphorylated KRAS4B binds BCL2L1 (also known as BCL-XL) to promote apoptosis (Bivona et al, 2006; reviewed in Ahearn et al, 2018).</bp:comment>
