    <bp:name rdf:datatype="http://www.w3.org/2001/XMLSchema#string">UniProt:O43559 FRS3</bp:name>
    <bp:name rdf:datatype="http://www.w3.org/2001/XMLSchema#string">FRS3</bp:name>
    <bp:xref rdf:resource="#UnificationXref454" />
    <bp:comment rdf:datatype="http://www.w3.org/2001/XMLSchema#string">FUNCTION Adapter protein that links FGF and NGF receptors to downstream signaling pathways. Involved in the activation of MAP kinases. Down-regulates ERK2 signaling by interfering with the phosphorylation and nuclear translocation of ERK2.SUBUNIT Binds NTRK1 (By similarity). Binds FGFR1, NGFR, GRB2, PTPN11 and ERK2.INTERACTION Phosphorylated by ULK2 in vitro (By similarity). Phosphorylated on tyrosine residues upon stimulation by BFGF or NGFB.</bp:comment>
  </bp:ProteinReference>
