    <bp:comment rdf:datatype="http://www.w3.org/2001/XMLSchema#string">FUNCTION Plays an important role in the regulation of cell proliferation, cell differentiation and cell migration. Required for normal ossification and bone development. Stimulates hepatic and intestinal proliferation.SUBUNIT Interacts with FGFR3 and FGFR4.SUBCELLULAR LOCATION Belongs to the heparin-binding growth factors family.</bp:comment>
