    <bp:xref rdf:resource="#UnificationXref600" />
    <bp:comment rdf:datatype="http://www.w3.org/2001/XMLSchema#string">SUBUNIT Probably associates with an alpha chain. Interacts (via C-terminus) with TRPC4.SUBCELLULAR LOCATION Detected prominently in the outer segments of photoreceptor rods and cones and in the basolateral membrane and cytosol of gastric epithelial cells.TISSUE SPECIFICITY Expressed at very low levels in many tissues, with strongest expression in cerebellum, spinal cord, stomach, pituitary gland, liver, pancreas, salivary gland, kidney, bladder, and heart.SIMILARITY Belongs to the spectrin family.</bp:comment>
