    <bp:comment rdf:datatype="http://www.w3.org/2001/XMLSchema#string">FUNCTION Probable guanine nucleotide exchange factor.SUBUNIT Interacts with Ras.INTERACTION Expressed in a wide variety of tissues with strong expression being seen in the heart, brain, kidney, spleen and testis.</bp:comment>
