    <bp:xref rdf:resource="#UnificationXref1231" />
    <bp:comment rdf:datatype="http://www.w3.org/2001/XMLSchema#string">FUNCTION Guanine nucleotide exchange factor (GEF) for Ral-A. Potential effector of GTPase HRas and Ras-related protein M-Ras. Negatively regulates Elk-1-dependent gene induction downstream of HRas and MEKK1 (By similarity).SUBUNIT Interacts with GTP-bound forms of RIT1, HRAS and MRAS.INTERACTION The Ras-associating domain plays a central role in the activation of Ral-A GDP/GTP exchange activity.</bp:comment>
