    <bp:eCNumber rdf:datatype="http://www.w3.org/2001/XMLSchema#string">3.1.3.16</bp:eCNumber>
    <bp:displayName rdf:datatype="http://www.w3.org/2001/XMLSchema#string">PP2A dephosphorylates KSR1</bp:displayName>
    <bp:xref rdf:resource="#UnificationXref1398" />
    <bp:xref rdf:resource="#UnificationXref1399" />
    <bp:comment rdf:datatype="http://www.w3.org/2001/XMLSchema#string">Upon growth factor stimulation, KSR1 is dephosphorylated at S406 by PP2A, disrupting 14-3-3 binding and promoting membrane translocation of KSR1 (Ory et al, 2003; Muller et al, 2001; reviewed in Raabe and Raap, 2003).</bp:comment>
