    <bp:comment rdf:datatype="http://www.w3.org/2001/XMLSchema#string">Single mechanism MAPK inhibitors such as ulixertinib and ravoxertinib bind to the activated forms of MAPK proteins and inhibit their intrinsic target-directed kinase activity (Germann et al, 2017; Blake et al, 2016; reviewed in Samatar and Poulikakos, 2014).</bp:comment>
