  <bp:ProteinReference rdf:ID="ProteinReference242">
    <bp:organism rdf:resource="#BioSource1" />
    <bp:name rdf:datatype="http://www.w3.org/2001/XMLSchema#string">UniProt:Q2MJR0 SPRED3</bp:name>
    <bp:name rdf:datatype="http://www.w3.org/2001/XMLSchema#string">SPRED3</bp:name>
    <bp:name rdf:datatype="http://www.w3.org/2001/XMLSchema#string">EVE-3</bp:name>
    <bp:xref rdf:resource="#UnificationXref2005" />
    <bp:comment rdf:datatype="http://www.w3.org/2001/XMLSchema#string">FUNCTION Tyrosine kinase substrate that inhibits growth-factor-mediated activation of MAP kinase (By similarity). Inhibits fibroblast growth factor (FGF)-induced retinal lens fiber differentiation, probably by inhibiting FGF-mediated phosphorylation of ERK1/2 (By similarity). Inhibits TGFB-induced epithelial-to-mesenchymal transition in lens epithelial cells (By similarity).SUBUNIT Interacts with palmitoyltransferase ZDHHC17/HIP14; the interaction leads to palmitoylation of SPRED3.SUBCELLULAR LOCATION Phosphorylated on tyrosine.PTM Palmitoylated by ZDHHC17/HIP14.PTM Ubiquitinated.</bp:comment>
  </bp:ProteinReference>
