    <bp:displayName rdf:datatype="http://www.w3.org/2001/XMLSchema#string">NF1 is degraded by the proteasome</bp:displayName>
    <bp:xref rdf:resource="#UnificationXref2167" />
    <bp:xref rdf:resource="#UnificationXref2168" />
    <bp:comment rdf:datatype="http://www.w3.org/2001/XMLSchema#string">After ubiquitination by the CUL3:KBTBD7 E3 RING ligase complex, NF1 is degraded by the proteasome (Cichowski et al, 2003; McGillicuddy et al, 2009; Hollstein et al, 2013).</bp:comment>
