    <bp:comment rdf:datatype="http://www.w3.org/2001/XMLSchema#string">MAP2K1 (MEK1) dissociates from phosphorylated MAPK3 (ERK1), allowing the dimerization of p-S202,204-MAP2K.</bp:comment>
